{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Psycholytic</strong></i> is a first-person puzzle game built around switching between reality and illusion. You'll explore intertwined worlds,\u00a0switching\u00a0worlds to solve puzzles and uncover truths hidden within your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch worlds between:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality</strong>: A stable but restrictive space. You can freely interact with devices but can\u2019t always reach your goal directly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illusion</strong>: Devices activate and reshape the environment, creating paths to bypass obstacles and achieve your objectives. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering the differences between both worlds is the key to solving intricate puzzles, reconstructing fragmented truths, and escaping the maze of your subconscious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras/d278ad2d82c262606fcca7dea76d6a4f.avif?t=1773678060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras_big/d278ad2d82c262606fcca7dea76d6a4f.avif?t=1773678060 width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Worlds</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely switch between reality and illusion to explore and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras/b26875ca0815f93a0bb200f9ff54e4da.poster.avif?t=1773678060\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras/b26875ca0815f93a0bb200f9ff54e4da.webm?t=1773678060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras/b26875ca0815f93a0bb200f9ff54e4da.mp4?t=1773678060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzle-solving</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated inventory or items. Observe, interact, and solve puzzles purely through your environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras/0a5329cdb3f125e7d2b302cd23bd1977.poster.avif?t=1773678060\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras/0a5329cdb3f125e7d2b302cd23bd1977.webm?t=1773678060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras/0a5329cdb3f125e7d2b302cd23bd1977.mp4?t=1773678060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Distinctive Visual Style</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Brutalism, Neo Concrete, and Minimalism, experience an intuitive blend of reality and illusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras/95e9c365d06dc6af939ed1ae6bfe3f45.poster.avif?t=1773678060\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras/95e9c365d06dc6af939ed1ae6bfe3f45.webm?t=1773678060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703500/extras/95e9c365d06dc6af939ed1ae6bfe3f45.mp4?t=1773678060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstat